  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Created from Slack question (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-project.slack.com/archives/C8B5TSR4J/p1692029486878149"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": "):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora 6 does support the usage of hash URIs on NonRDFSources, but they are not visible on the Admin UI (section \"Other resources\" is missing for NonRDFSources on the Fedora UI).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A put to <NonRDFSource-URI>/fcr:metadata that includes such HashURIs (e.g with triples like <NonRDFSource-URI>#<someHash> <somePredicate> \"someLIteral\") is accepted. The additional resources are returned correctly on the API.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
